{"title":"August Ferdinand Mobius","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Franz Mobius is a cool guy who made <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Homogeneous_coordinates\" title=\"Homogeneous coordinates\">homogeneous coordinates</a>. He is also credited for inventing the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mobius_Strip\" title=\"Mobius Strip\">Mobius Strip</a>. He also invented <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mass_points\" title=\"Mass points\">Mass points</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261019170423\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:38106:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261019170423 and revision id 294089. Rendering was triggered because: page-edit\n -->\n</div>"}